# Runtime configuration
#
# A derived repository keeps this file — bootstrap names `.gitignore` as one of the
# generic files that survives the vendor step — and both bootstrap and the sangha
# protocol prescribe `git add -A`. One was found carrying an untracked `.env` that
# any of those would have staged. It had never been committed; the next one may not
# be so lucky.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Rust
# The yidam binary, installed per-repository rather than into ~/.cargo/bin so that
# a machine with several yidam repositories does not run one repo's pinned build
# against another's corpus. `.yidam/bin` in a derived repo, `.local/bin` here.
.local/
.yidam/bin/
target/
# `cargo --target-dir` output under any name. `target/` alone missed `target-pin/`, which a
# `git add -A` then swept 567 build artifacts out of.
target-*/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# Node / TypeScript
node_modules/
dist/
.pnpm-store/
*.tsbuildinfo

# LanceDB
*.lance/

# mise
.mise.local.toml

# macOS
.DS_Store
